        <p>Any lot advertised may be had on the deferred payment system at a charge of 5 per cent. Good's c s.chati ,ed vvlt s-,t, 4factory. Geishon pnrctihse or take in exckange a eingte article or complete houses of furniture. COMPARE PRICES. LATE THE PROPERTY OF A BANDMASTER. Complete house of furniture, consisting of the whole furniture fnr three rooms, sitting room, bedroom, full size bedstead, mattrass, bed, bolster, pillows, sheets, blankets, bolster case, pillow slips, and kitchen complete, all like new; price 14 guineas, or 5 per cent extra on the deferred payment sptem. 001 and inspect them. No harm done if you don't buy.</p>
        <p>UNDER THE CLOCK.</p>
        <p>IN BRIDGE STREET, WARRINGTON</p>
        <p>GERSHON'S UNIVERSAL ARCADE, 14, Oldham-stteet, Manchester. (Next to the Adelphl Bank).</p>
        <p>FOR GOOD BOOTS.</p>
        <p>LATE the PROPERTY of a SCHOOLMASTER. A Charmiug House of Furniture, really like new. It consists of dining room sr.ite in leather, extending dining table, carpet, rug, fender, fire brasses, lace curtains, window pole complete, magnificent bedroom suite (not painted, solid wood), enclosed dresing-table, large bevelled glass attached; enclosed washstand, marble slab, tile back, and bevelled shav- ing mirror, they torm to complete chest of drawers; full-size handsome black and brass bedstead, wire spring mattress, bed, bolster, pillows, sheets, b ankets, pillow slips, bolster cases, toilet set, carpet, complete furniture for kitchen, floor- cloth for same, ditto for lobby and stairs. Call End inspect the lot. Get a complete list, and you will say they are a marvel of cheapness for 24 guineas, or 5 per cent extra on the deferred payment system.</p>
        <p>GERSHON, UNIVERSAL FIANISHING ARCADE. 44, Oldham-street, Manchf-Eter, next to the Adelphi Bank.</p>
        <p>T ATE THE PROPERTY OF A POSTMASTER. Another complete home, well worthy the attention of those about furniAling, all made by a noted maker; dining- room ,drawin g-roorn ,three bedrooms complete and kitchen.any amount of sundries, all guaranteed, condition is spotless, call and see them, packed, warranted, arid delivered for £3B, or 5 per cent. extra if on the deferred payment system.</p>
        <p>GERSHON'S UNIVERSAL FURNISHING ARCADE, 44, Oldham-street, Manchester, next to the Adelphi Bank.</p>
        <p>I Li THE PROPERTY OF A DOCTOR AT HIGH BR B HOUGHTON. This lot was let on hire by a house who charged £175 for them; the lot wants seeing to effect a speedy sale; cent dining-room in solid walnut (the sideboard is well worth £25). the drawing-room in initid rosewood, the bedrooms are In satin walnut wood and American walnut. grandbedsteads, oil painting, kitchen furniture, dinner set, and sundries; space prevents anything like a complete list, call to see them. Don't forget they were sent out on hire for £175 ; ray price. £5B, or 5 per cent. extra on the deferred payment system.</p>
