        <p>Has an established reputation for giving Care fu and Prompt Attention to the wants of all Customers ' and its facilities for the production of Good Work of every kind--from the smallest typographic trifle to the biggest mural " Mammoth " are available to the public, at prices which are strictly moderate. Careless, inartistic, and slovenly printing is the ban of businessmen. They find it doesn't pay to have it—even at" the lowest tender,"</p>
