      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1896-03-07_WidnesExaminer_art0032" n="art0032">
        <head>GERSHON, 44, OLDHAI44-STRERTIMANCHESTER.</head>
        <p>GERSHON, 44, OLDHAI44-STRERTIMANCHESTER.</p>
        <p>LATE THE PROPERTY OF A MANCHESTER MERCHANT, who was only married seven months. The goods are offered for sale by order of the trustees, in consequence of death. Every article is like new, and I guar- rantee that no house iri Manchester can supply a complete house like it for tour times the price quoted. I may here remark that the carpets and floor covering, being planned to the rooms. I have arranged to supply new carpete and linol ,rtms. and whoever buys the lot will have perfect free- dom to select the same. The dining room, drawing room. anl various bed rooms are furnished with goods of the best quality. All I ask is for intending customers to inspect the k lot, which I offer for £9B cash, warranted and delivered, or 15 ter cent extra on the deterred payment system.</p>
        <p>GERSHON'S UNIVERSAL FURNISHING ARCADE, 44, Oldham-street, Manchester, next to the Adelphi Bank.</p>
        <p>ATE THE PROPERTY OF A CLERGYMAN.</p>
        <p>Such a nice smart Dining Room in Leather Small chairs (padded back), couch, and easy chairs to match, solid frames. spring stuffed, a dead bargain for £5 15s ; handsome side- board to match, with bevelled glass back, £4 18s. ; extending dining table, to match with extra 1eaf,388.; large size carpet, bordered, and rug to match, 285.; overmantel, a Perfect beauty, 305.; fender, dogs, and fire brasses, 18s, the lot; or the entire dining-room lot as above for £l6 75., or five per cent extra on the deferred payment system.</p>
        <p>GERSHON'S UNIVERSAL FURNISHING ARCADE, 44, Oldham-street, Manchester, next to the Adelphi Bank</p>
        <p>T ATE TUE PROPERTY OF Mits. WOODWIN. Li A charming Suite,which I have re-covered in handsome saddle bags; the woodwork is second hand, covering new; small chairs, easy chairs, and couch,all to match; worth £l5: price now, £.5 15s. Cabinet, Table, and Overmantel to match. making a charming lot for very little money, Addb per cent. if on the deterred payment system.</p>
        <p>GERSHON'S UNIVERSAL FURNISHING ARCADE. 44, Oldham-street, Manchester next to the Adelphi,Bank.</p>
        <p>LATE THE PROPERTY OF' A BANKRUPT' SILK MERCHANT.. Without doubt the handsomest fittings for a dining-roonx ever seen. Money cannot buy better. The small chairs are most handsomely carved. The lounge chairs and couch are all upholstered in a real crocodile leather, everlasting wear. The handsome sideboard, overmantel. and large extending dining table are all in dark (near.y black) Chippendale maho- gany. I am informed they cost neariy £200; can now be had for 68 guineas, I have also the drawing room, which is simply magnificent. and a number of bedroom suites. One suite is in real satinwood, richly inlaid, and I know for a positive fact it cost two years 6ince 250 guineas, and is now on offer for 85 guineas. Another massive suite in solid wal- nutwood cannot be described, it's quite equal to new, in fact, better, it cost £9s—the invoice is in my possesslon—can now be had for 55 guineas, warranted and delivered.</p>
        <p>GERSHON'S UNIVERSAL FURNISHING ARCADE. 44, Oldham-street, Manehestr, next to the Adelphi Bank.</p>
