        <p>WARRINGTON TOWN COUNCIL.</p>
        <p>The monthly meeting of this Council was held at the Town Hall on Tuesday. The Mayor (Councillor James Vairclough) presided, and there were also present : Aldermen Francomb, Wright, Hutchinson. Sutton, 'ereenall, Bolton; Councillors Shaw Green, Plumpton, Pierpoint, Roberts, Smethurst, Bennett. Skelton, Evans, Ellison, Furness, Duncan, Tinnion, Rogers, Woods, Longton, Shaw, Davies, Baird, Shillcock, Wilkinson, neßherd, Garner, Reaton, Monks, Lee,; Messrs. J. Lyon VII?Ittle (town clerk) ; Longdin (borough surveyor) ; Patrhurat (borough treasurer) ; Madeley (librarian), • and S. Wilson (assistant town clerk).</p>
        <p>ELECTIVE AUDITORS. The MAYOR presented the return of the election of two elective auditors (Messrs. John Harrison and James .Bolton), and said he had appointed Councillor Arthur Bennett his auditc4r.</p>
