        <p>ADVENTUROUS VOYAGE OF THE FRAM. SUCCESS OF DR. NANSEN'S EXPEDITION. The reported success of Dr. Nansen's Fxpedition has been flashed all over the world, and if the North Pole has really this time been discovered, it will cause intense excitement in all the geographical societies. Dr. Nansert will have achieved for Norway a distinguishod celebrity wh ch England and America have spent imm, use slims t attain nevertheless both England and America will ungrudgingly congratulate Norway upon the remarkable success. We trust the reported success will prove absolute, and in this event Worsley's Famous Furnishing &amp;stab isliment will endeavour to have nailed to the North Pole the well-known advertisement :</p>
